    {
      "heading": "Findings",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Three of the five markers were intact and matched their recorded positions. The fourth had been moved about ten metres downhill by a rockfall, and its base plate was cracked. The fifth could not be found, although the team searched the slope below it for most of an afternoon. A replacement marker will be set on the next visit, once the pass is open.",
